  "note": "The sealed rule set. One entry per independently violable invariant, each naming exactly one owner key, and docs/steering/rules.md carries exactly one body per entry in this order. This manifest is the criterion; the number of entries follows from it and is reported rather than asserted, so a further rule is a deliberate revision of this file and never an edit to a threshold.",
