    "head": "a43ce6a9fe3c2ffd17fcb084e596a0c709ba88c9",
    "reason": "User-authorized adoption of 2026-10-30: apply R19 to tangible major-feature user journeys through supported public entrypoints and production composition, with detail in the existing release-gate policy; coordinate workflow, review, epic and versioned-roadmap owners. Preserve invariant identities, bounded repair acceptance, sealed predicates and recorded history."
  },
